{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["אם עלה — when he volunteers, in this expression. And further on it explains: ואם זבח שלמים." "לרצונו — if he offers an unblemished male and [brings it] to the entrance of the Tent of Meeting, then it will be accepted for him. But concerning a sick or blemished animal it is written: הירצך או הישא פניך. And likewise: ומנחה לא ארצה מידכם."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:48:09.104483599Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}